spotify-watch

# Machine-class gates, prompted at `chezmoi init` (see .chezmoi.toml.tmpl):
#
# includePrivate — personal vault/VPN tools and data, plus ssh config with
#   my home hosts. Work machines answer "no". OS suffixes
#   stay for the rbw config paths only because rbw looks in a different place
#   on each platform.
#
# includeDesktop — full desktop tier: GUI applications and experimental agent
#   harnesses like pi. Headless boxes (homelab, throwaway VMs) answer "no".
#
# Both default to false via `dig`, so a machine whose config predates a flag is
# safe until it re-inits.
