# Omarchy: allow-list. I'm migrating to Omarchy one piece at a time and keep
# it as close to stock as possible, so on Omarchy everything in this repo is
# ignored except what is listed below. Porting something means adding its
# target paths here (and every parent directory, because an ignored directory
# hides its children), with the reason in DECISIONS.md. This also keeps the
# apt-based *_linux.sh scripts, which would fail on Arch, off Omarchy.
